\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"color:#d92142;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;\">\n           特别特别的推荐，中深焙，好甜好顺滑，还有柑橘调，比浅焙更耐喝～\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          Cusco区域是上图紫色部分，图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于\n           <span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n            Chiriloma\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          绮莉洛玛庄园位于库斯科区域的Chirumbia山谷，种植面积3.5公顷，坐落于野生动植物群中。庄园的名字寓意是 Chiri 是冷的意思，Loma是高的地方，也正代表了庄园所处的地理气候环境，庄园种植品种有瑰夏Gesha（占比80%）、帕卡马拉Pacamara、新世界Mundo Novo、波旁Bourbon、卡杜拉Caturra、爪哇Java和铁皮卡Typica。2017年，诺里·基斯佩·桑托斯\n          <span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           Nory Quispe Santos\n          </span>\n          开始咖啡种植的生涯，收获的第一批咖啡在国际市场的反响很好。2021年，庄园决定参加秘鲁卓越杯（CoE）竞赛，并取得了第四名的成绩。对咖啡的热情使他们精力充沛，致力于生产出全秘鲁甚至全世界zui好的咖啡。与此同时，庄园也是原始森林的守护者，坚持与保护生态环境携手并行。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QCZXtc898cnmibicvbb4icZ4M1PbuZ5Zr6cBjjyTqI1YGtERIHQGoUUCheUkbukSWSqDGkYaImHI42w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QCZXtc898cnmibicvbb4icZ4MVsTXALvwAUjQuNUqG7LJiad9yVsibZvlap4O5IwlYCAdCliaVkZ69FnpQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QCZXtc898cnmibicvbb4icZ4MEWLusicNUZPot1OVpZCrwEdicOjwYN6BzX7qibtSQYpaBtEiaEuWrpLAIw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          特别干净，很整洁\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2021 Peru CoE #4\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          20\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Peru CoE #4\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2023 Peru CoE #3\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='ou